    "answer": {
      "short": "No. Replacing $t$ with $-t$ reverses the direction of travel along the same curve.",
      "worked": "No. Both coordinates are evaluated at the same parameter value $-t$. As $t$ increases, $-t$ decreases, so the same curve is traced in reverse order. This changes the direction of travel rather than reflecting the curve.",
